                "the center of a city"
              ],
              "explanation": "formula nghĩa là công thức (a mathematical rule).",
              "correctAnswer": "C"
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "content": "practical",
              "options": [
                "the way it used to be",
                "useful",
                "to complain",
                "money for school"
